# Always Push Live And Verify

This is a standing instruction for every turn in this repo.

- After any completed code, copy, style, or config change, immediately `git add`, commit, and `git push -u origin main`.
- Do not wait for a later "push it live" message. Shipping to GitHub is part of finishing the work.
- If `origin` is missing, add `https://github.com/myaifunnels/jdc-elite-society.git` and push `main`.
- Use a concise commit message that matches the change just made.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, keys, tokens).
- After every push, verify production at https://coachjdc.org/:
  - Confirm the latest Render deploy is live.
  - Open or fetch the homepage and check that the expected hero copy, video, and CTAs are actually on the public site.
  - If the site is stale, failing, or still deploying, say so clearly and keep watching until it is live or the blocker is known.
- If the push or live check fails, report the error and continue with the next safe recovery step.
